# Search-only exclusions for ripgrep (and so for coding agents' search).
# Git ignores this file. Checks still read several of these paths, so nothing
# here may be moved or deleted on this file's account. `rg -uu` searches everything.

# Vendored Three.js and generated model exports
web/v02/workshop/vendor/
web/v02/workshop/exports/*.json

# Dated evidence: history, not the current specification
docs/balance/
docs/releases/
docs/playtests/
docs/v02/

# Review captures and audits (workflows stay searchable)
.github/*/
!.github/workflows/

package-lock.json
